  Hi #{@user.username},

  This is a final reminder that Nitrous Lite will be shut down completely on July 15, 2015.

  You have #{@boxes.size} remaining #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} on Nitrous Lite: #{@boxes.to_sentence}

  The above #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} will be terminated and no longer be
  available upon the shutdown of Nitrous Lite.

  We believe strongly in data portability, so we have provided two ways to
  preserve your data.

  First, our recommended approach: migrating your
  #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} to a new account on Nitrous Pro.  You can
  find a migration guide at
  [http://docs.nitrous.io/v1.0/docs/migrate-your-box-to-nitrous-pro](http://docs.nitrous.io/v1.0/docs/migrate-your-box-to-nitrous-pro).

  Alternately, if you only wish to backup your data without a new account, you
  can find a guide on doing so at
  [http://help.nitrous.io/backup/](http://help.nitrous.io/backup/).

  We hope to see you on [Nitrous
  Pro](https://pro.nitrous.io) soon!

  If you have any questions or need any help at all, let us know at
  [support@nitrous.io](mailto:support@nitrous.io).

  Cheers,<br>
  The Nitrous Team
